    "detailed_description": "<i>Warning: This game is not intended for people with photosensitive epilepsy.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888540/extras/48eb8df958a964dcc81833127e4e0a94.avif?t=1747920047\" width=600 height=1175 /></span><br><br><strong>Translated:</strong><br>Why Absolute-Full-Life?<br><br>you can middle finger<br>your enemies when they<br>annoy you a lot<br><br>Here you will find<br>manual reloading that<br>you can do with<br>the mouse<br><br>Many complex<br>puzzles also with<br>decisions that will have<br>consequences for<br>the future<br><br>Re-usable weapons<br>with different<br>upguards that<br>cause less in-game<br>dying, on a variant<br>of complex enemies<br><br>A big open world like<br>your mom of different<br>unique places that <br>require better<br>equipment and<br>don't cuddle<br>with you<br><br>you can have<br>your own dog<br>sidekick, if of course you<br>pass the test that leads<br>to getting one<br><br><strong>Key elements:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manual reloading</li><li>Unique graphics and styling</li><li>Non-linear story containing several secrets side quests</li><li>Up to several weapons with different benefits</li><li>Unique enemies on which different tactics apply</li><li>Your dad will come back home with milk</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Warning: This game is not intended for people with photosensitive epilepsy.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888540/extras/48eb8df958a964dcc81833127e4e0a94.avif?t=1747920047\" width=600 height=1175 /></span><br><br><strong>Translated:</strong><br>Why Absolute-Full-Life?<br><br>you can middle finger<br>your enemies when they<br>annoy you a lot<br><br>Here you will find<br>manual reloading that<br>you can do with<br>the mouse<br><br>Many complex<br>puzzles also with<br>decisions that will have<br>consequences for<br>the future<br><br>Re-usable weapons<br>with different<br>upguards that<br>cause less in-game<br>dying, on a variant<br>of complex enemies<br><br>A big open world like<br>your mom of different<br>unique places that <br>require better<br>equipment and<br>don't cuddle<br>with you<br><br>you can have<br>your own dog<br>sidekick, if of course you<br>pass the test that leads<br>to getting one<br><br><strong>Key elements:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manual reloading</li><li>Unique graphics and styling</li><li>Non-linear story containing several secrets side quests</li><li>Up to several weapons with different benefits</li><li>Unique enemies on which different tactics apply</li><li>Your dad will come back home with milk</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Colourful survival horror first-person shooter with manual weapon reloading and a mystery environment. Discover every secrets in an open world full of diverse enemies and hidden locations.",
